Bundled boundary data
=====================

SignalK Starlink Offshore ships pre-converted, compressed world datasets for
two layers used to classify the vessel's maritime zone:

  1. territorial sea  - Marine Regions (VLIZ) Territorial Seas (12NM) v4
  2. coast            - Marine Regions (VLIZ) land + internal waters +
                        archipelagic waters, dissolved per country

The two layers share the same baselines and tile cleanly, so a position never
falls into a sliver between them. The coast is everything landward of the
baselines the territorial sea is measured from (land and internal /
archipelagic waters); there is no separate land versus internal-waters
distinction.

