2. Coast
--------
Source data (all Flanders Marine Institute, VLIZ):
  Maritime Boundaries Geodatabase: World Internal Waters, version 4
    https://www.marineregions.org/  ·  https://doi.org/10.14284/631
  Maritime Boundaries Geodatabase: Archipelagic Waters, version 4
    https://www.marineregions.org/  ·  https://doi.org/10.14284/629
  World Countries 2014 land (the normal baseline of the boundaries),
    accessed via the VLIZ WFS (`MarineRegions:worldcountries_esri_2014`,
    https://geo.vliz.be/geoserver)
  The three are dissolved into one polygon set per country by
  `tools/build-coast.js`.

